\f3\b0  El Tresillo cubano.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f5\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
E(5, 16):
\f3\b0  Clave de Bossa Nova / Son.\
